name: Recorded revision history and honest Fleet comparison recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/fleet_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/fleet_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART before
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-unaccepted
expect-not: Map ✓
paste-file: @ART/register-command.txt
keys: Enter
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 owned registered | registered
submit: run fleet:status
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 0C 0H records | status
submit: run fleet:findings {"limit":2}
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 2 current row(s) | current-query
expect: Bounded query of current records
expect: Owned policy
paste-file: @ART/comparison-command.txt
keys: Enter
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Fix status requires a separate human decision | comparison-result
expect: base-only
expect: head-only
expect: both
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | comparison-reader
resize: 160x48
live-snap: comparison-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: comparison-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: comparison-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: comparison-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: comparison-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: comparison-tail-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-1-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-2-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-3-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-4-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-5-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-6-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-7-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-8-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-9-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-10-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: comparison-page-11-40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: comparison-start-40x12
ask: Can an operator read both SHAs, all three recorded presence groups and matching uncertainty at every size without interpreting absence as a fix?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
submit: run fleet:ingest
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Skipped target: skipped: | partial-ingest
ask: Does partial ingestion identify the skipped target without claiming complete Fleet coverage or completing Map?
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-after-read
expect-not: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/fleet_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted-setup
expect-not: Map ✓
paste-file: @ART/comparison-command.txt
keys: Enter
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Fix status requires a separate human decision | restarted-comparison
expect: base-only
expect: head-only
expect: both
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/fleet_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart preserve four observations and the same comparison while creating no fix decisions, model requests or Map acceptance?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-restart-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
